WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.830 --> 01:31.180
[My Journey to You]

01:31.210 --> 01:34.100
[Episode 24]

02:14.110 --> 02:15.260
A member of Wufeng.

02:16.140 --> 02:17.020
You're just

02:17.020 --> 02:17.740
a nobody.

02:18.420 --> 02:20.150
I'm a member of the Gong family.

02:23.150 --> 02:24.200
I used to

02:25.440 --> 02:27.300
be a member of the Gong family too.

02:38.420 --> 02:39.680
Did you fail to stop him

02:40.980 --> 02:42.250
or did you let him go?

02:44.020 --> 02:44.560
No.

02:45.480 --> 02:46.660
There must be something wrong.

02:46.660 --> 02:47.460
What's wrong?

02:48.130 --> 02:48.910
Last night, he already got

02:48.910 --> 02:50.570
the plan of the Infinite Heat.

02:51.090 --> 02:52.220
Why didn't he leave?

02:52.420 --> 02:54.120
Why did he wait until everyone had come to him

02:54.120 --> 02:56.250
before confronting us face-to-face?

02:56.470 --> 02:57.210
It seems like

02:58.160 --> 02:59.710
he already knew.

03:02.220 --> 03:03.450
He must have known

03:04.050 --> 03:06.820
that the other half of the Infinite Heat's Coded Heart Sutra

03:06.820 --> 03:07.770
is on my body.

03:10.520 --> 03:11.170
Yun.

03:12.220 --> 03:13.880
He's looking for Yun Weishan.

03:14.030 --> 03:16.290
He wants to threaten me with Yun Weishan.

03:16.410 --> 03:16.930
No.

03:19.920 --> 03:20.850
You can't go out.

03:23.140 --> 03:24.620
I was going to find you.

03:25.620 --> 03:28.060
I didn't expect you to show up in front of me.

04:08.130 --> 04:08.660
Brother.

04:09.450 --> 04:11.020
It's never too late to repent.

04:11.020 --> 04:12.110
You beat me

04:12.370 --> 04:14.170
in the Trial of the Three Realms.

04:14.220 --> 04:15.020
But now,

04:16.269 --> 04:17.740
you are no match for me.

04:19.420 --> 04:20.380
To defeat Gong Huanyu,

04:20.380 --> 04:20.820
Sword Wielder,

04:20.820 --> 04:22.060
you must master

04:22.060 --> 04:23.050
all the nine forms of saber techniques

04:23.050 --> 04:24.380
of the Snow, Moon, and Flower.

04:24.380 --> 04:26.780
You're still lacking the Three Forms of Mirror Flower.

04:26.780 --> 04:27.580
I've tried it.

04:28.670 --> 04:30.220
Although I have Yun's Qingfeng mental technique

04:30.220 --> 04:31.540
to help me in my cultivation,

04:31.540 --> 04:32.820
my internal skill is insufficient.

04:32.820 --> 04:34.080
I can't master it fast.

04:34.780 --> 04:35.920
Jin Fan and I

04:36.460 --> 04:38.720
can transfer our internal skills to you.

04:40.680 --> 04:42.530
Yuanzhi, Xue Chongzi, and I

04:42.790 --> 04:44.390
will go and buy you some time.

04:44.470 --> 04:45.330
Sword Wielder.

04:45.820 --> 04:47.260
The survival of the Gong family

04:47.260 --> 04:48.190
is in your hands.

05:27.580 --> 05:28.110
Brother.

05:43.220 --> 05:44.620
It's indeed witchcraft.

05:50.300 --> 05:51.730
I'll open up all your eight extraordinary meridians

05:51.730 --> 05:52.570
and

05:52.920 --> 05:55.430
help you transfer your internal skills quickly.

05:55.430 --> 05:57.090
But you mustn't be impatient.

05:57.159 --> 05:58.620
Because when all your meridians are opened up,

05:58.620 --> 05:59.820
it's very dangerous.

06:00.120 --> 06:02.520
It's easy for your aura to become deviated.

06:23.620 --> 06:25.080
[Three Forms of Wind Snow]

06:31.500 --> 06:32.360
Sword Wielder.

06:32.810 --> 06:33.470
I'll go too.

07:02.040 --> 07:03.490
Where are the Sword Wielder and Jin Fan?

07:03.490 --> 07:04.490
Why haven't they come out yet?

07:04.490 --> 07:06.420
We need to buy some time for the Sword Wielder.

07:06.420 --> 07:07.620
Protect Yun Weishan.

07:07.900 --> 07:09.430
She must persist to the end.

07:09.780 --> 07:11.380
The Sword Wielder needs her.

07:41.850 --> 07:42.650
Young Master.

07:47.340 --> 07:47.980
Brother.

07:49.260 --> 07:50.590
I don’t want to kill you.

08:12.710 --> 08:14.310
[Three Forms of Wind Flower]

08:17.070 --> 08:18.600
Three Forms of Wind Flower?

08:21.230 --> 08:22.900
You're in your death throes.

09:20.450 --> 09:23.780
[Three Forms of Mirror Flower] [The mastermind is Wufeng.]

09:31.400 --> 09:32.530
That's impossible.

09:56.900 --> 09:58.030
Where are you going?

10:00.330 --> 10:01.990
You've already abandoned me.

10:02.820 --> 10:04.080
Why shouldn't I leave?

10:49.610 --> 10:52.310
Gong Huanyu lied to me, saying it was a cooperation,

10:52.310 --> 10:55.170
but he just wanted to monopolize the Infinite Heat.

10:58.180 --> 11:00.140
And you and I were husband and wife,

11:02.420 --> 11:04.220
but you still showed me no mercy.

11:09.490 --> 11:10.750
Why should I show mercy

11:13.060 --> 11:14.390
to someone from Wufeng?

11:15.540 --> 11:17.600
But my heart is no longer with Wufeng.

11:19.870 --> 11:20.930
I don't believe it.

11:25.100 --> 11:26.090
I'm not lying.

11:27.220 --> 11:29.420
I'm indeed an orphan of the Gushan Sect.

11:30.880 --> 11:33.040
Back then, when I escaped from the secret tunnel,

11:33.040 --> 11:35.840
I fell off a cliff and hit my head and lost my memory.

11:36.730 --> 11:38.590
Dianzhu brought me back with her.

11:39.060 --> 11:40.260
She lied to me and said

11:40.560 --> 11:41.620
I was her disciple.

11:42.510 --> 11:43.540
She took me in

11:44.260 --> 11:45.590
and made me work for her.

11:47.580 --> 11:48.230
And then?

11:50.980 --> 11:53.440
Later, I regained my memory little by little

11:54.030 --> 11:55.960
and put on an act to stay by her side.

11:57.380 --> 11:58.600
I told you

11:59.620 --> 12:02.620
that two years ago, I tried to poison Dianzhu to death.

12:03.380 --> 12:04.980
After Dianzhu was poisoned,

12:05.770 --> 12:07.070
the chief of Wufeng

12:07.830 --> 12:11.490
actually canceled the Wufeng meeting, which was unprecedented.

12:11.940 --> 12:13.400
Through these two things,

12:13.730 --> 12:14.950
I inferred

12:17.040 --> 12:18.370
that the chief of Wufeng

12:19.380 --> 12:20.320
is Dianzhu.

12:22.390 --> 12:24.650
That's why I've been working for Wufeng.

12:24.760 --> 12:25.830
So that one day,

12:25.860 --> 12:26.860
I can kill Dianzhu

12:26.880 --> 12:27.880
and take revenge.

12:30.350 --> 12:30.870
Now,

12:32.100 --> 12:33.610
I have the Infinite Heat.

12:34.470 --> 12:36.730
I can eliminate Wufeng and kill Dianzhu.

12:42.380 --> 12:43.840
I've told you everything.

12:45.770 --> 12:47.630
Could you spare my life this time?

12:50.590 --> 12:51.990
Give me the Infinite Heat

12:53.690 --> 12:54.820
and I'll let you off.

13:00.480 --> 13:01.790
What if I don't want to?

13:17.760 --> 13:18.890
Eliminating Wufeng

13:19.720 --> 13:21.450
is good for the Gong family too.

13:23.130 --> 13:24.620
Why aren't you willing?

13:29.980 --> 13:31.120
The Infinite Heat

13:34.370 --> 13:36.770
must not fall into the hands of an outsider.

13:42.480 --> 13:43.270
Besides,

13:46.870 --> 13:48.930
how would I know if you won't lie to me?

14:02.960 --> 14:04.240
I won't lie to you.

14:14.520 --> 14:15.180
Because...

14:25.120 --> 14:30.510
♫You whisper loving words in my ear♫

14:32.000 --> 14:36.900
♫Yet we have no choice but to part♫

14:39.070 --> 14:44.970
♫I hold the blade in my hand♫

14:45.220 --> 14:50.210
♫And slice through the night♫

14:52.220 --> 14:55.650
♫Feelings are always so bland on paper♫

14:56.100 --> 14:58.830
♫But writing it feels so bitter and intolerable♫

14:59.230 --> 15:02.740
♫I mock people who are obsessed with love and hate♫

15:03.170 --> 15:05.910
♫But only half my heart remains♫

15:06.260 --> 15:10.300
♫Only I looked up when we crossed paths♫

15:10.650 --> 15:12.750
♫Leaving a moment behind♫

15:13.240 --> 15:17.470
♫At the shore of the flow of time♫

15:17.490 --> 15:19.730
♫I heard a door open♫

15:19.520 --> 15:20.960
Love is an acquired ability.

15:20.140 --> 15:23.210
♫The later the night, the warmer the heart♫

15:22.060 --> 15:23.970
Liking someone isn't innate.

15:23.600 --> 15:26.660
♫Yet the hug feels colder than the snow♫

15:28.180 --> 15:31.950
♫Why do we stand side by side?♫

15:28.670 --> 15:29.830
Do you like it?

15:33.500 --> 15:34.360
I didn't expect

15:35.090 --> 15:40.860
♫Like fireflies meeting in the same night♫

15:35.970 --> 15:38.230
that the fragrance of this bay laurel ink

15:38.280 --> 15:40.170
can really calm people down.

15:42.090 --> 15:47.250
♫But the heart catches fire♫

15:43.720 --> 15:44.720
Then, from now on,

15:45.510 --> 15:49.250
I'll frequently grind ink for you and accompany you in your studies.

15:49.250 --> 15:54.940
♫The night is young but the heart is heavy♫

15:50.120 --> 15:51.120
In this lifetime,

15:51.970 --> 15:53.500
I'll always be by your side.

15:55.390 --> 16:01.320
♫The moth embraces the blazing flames♫

16:02.320 --> 16:05.850
♫Feelings are always so bland on paper♫

16:06.260 --> 16:08.900
♫But I use half my lifetime to repay it♫

16:09.340 --> 16:12.940
♫Eyes adorned with the stars and the moon♫

16:13.280 --> 16:15.980
♫But full of separation♫

16:16.390 --> 16:20.330
♫You have no desire to continue fighting, I consent♫

16:17.510 --> 16:18.040
Brother.

16:18.390 --> 16:20.320
Did you just let Shangguan Qian go?

16:20.660 --> 16:23.030
♫Just for a moment♫

16:23.320 --> 16:27.300
♫On the shore of the inkstone♫

16:24.500 --> 16:26.700
Otherwise, I wouldn't have let her off.

16:27.790 --> 16:29.680
♫I see flowers blooming halfway♫

16:29.980 --> 16:33.300
♫Turn around and I'll help you fulfill it♫

16:33.490 --> 16:36.640
♫A farewell lingers on more than staying together♫

16:36.780 --> 16:37.520
Let her off?

16:38.270 --> 16:39.620
♫Why♫

16:40.920 --> 16:44.000
♫Unwilling♫

16:44.330 --> 16:47.470
♫You said that the fragrant and green bay laurel♫

16:46.330 --> 16:47.080
Let her go.

16:47.500 --> 16:50.840
♫Cannot beat the snow between the brows♫

16:51.470 --> 16:53.480
♫I said that the deep forest rocks♫

16:52.650 --> 16:54.870
I'm pregnant with the Gong family's baby.

16:53.510 --> 16:57.580
♫Reflect on the moon in the middle of the lake♫

16:58.370 --> 17:04.819
♫A love letter is the hardest to write♫

17:05.410 --> 17:11.200
♫For the fireflies, I'm willing for the night to be eternal♫

17:12.460 --> 17:16.420
♫I didn't speak but I beg♫

17:16.819 --> 17:18.920
♫For you to stay for the last time♫

17:19.400 --> 17:23.420
♫You didn't look back, but I'm still♫

17:23.760 --> 17:25.950
♫Waiting in place♫

17:26.060 --> 17:29.240
♫The later the night, the more confused the heart gets♫

17:29.510 --> 17:33.000
♫Embracing the blade for warmth♫

17:34.310 --> 17:40.100
♫Sad and lamentable♫

17:40.130 --> 17:41.630
♫It's all because♫

17:42.260 --> 17:43.350
♫The night♫

17:45.570 --> 17:49.200
♫Is young♫

18:36.880 --> 18:38.460
The Wufeng organization has been rampant.

18:38.460 --> 18:39.830
Since they rose abruptly, for decades,

18:39.830 --> 18:42.180
they've been spreading fear throughout the martial world.

18:42.180 --> 18:44.990
They control people from the martial world with the Fortnight Flies.

18:44.990 --> 18:46.010
Wherever they went,

18:46.010 --> 18:47.540
they stirred up bloodshed.

18:47.860 --> 18:48.950
After investigation,

18:48.950 --> 18:50.590
we've found out that the Fortnight Flies is not a poison.

18:50.590 --> 18:51.520
It's not lethal.

18:52.090 --> 18:54.390
It's just an illusion that puts the martial world in shackles.

18:54.390 --> 18:55.940
And the real identity

18:56.050 --> 18:57.060
of Qingfeng Sect's Dianzhu

18:57.060 --> 18:58.320
is the chief of Wufeng.

18:59.160 --> 19:00.970
Dianzhu has a fierce and violent temperament.

19:00.970 --> 19:03.380
She snatched kids and trained them into Wufeng spies.

19:03.380 --> 19:04.370
She's ruthless.

19:04.860 --> 19:06.080
It made the martial world furious,

19:06.080 --> 19:07.540
but no one dared to resist.

19:07.820 --> 19:09.530
Now, the Gong family has specially issued an announcement.

19:09.530 --> 19:10.790
I hope all the scholars

19:10.810 --> 19:12.010
and heroes from all walks of life

19:12.010 --> 19:14.480
will no longer be threatened or shackled by Wufeng,

19:14.480 --> 19:15.440
and help restore peace

19:15.440 --> 19:16.640
to the martial world.

19:42.250 --> 19:44.240
What's frozen melts and spring comes.

19:44.240 --> 19:46.180
The fish leaps across a thousand miles.

19:46.180 --> 19:48.110
The roc's wings climb up to Heaven.

19:49.780 --> 19:50.840
You finally did it.

20:09.700 --> 20:10.630
It's really you.

20:22.400 --> 20:24.000
Actually, I knew it long ago.

20:25.910 --> 20:26.710
But...

20:30.630 --> 20:31.960
I really miss my father.

20:40.420 --> 20:42.980
Before entering the Third Realm of the Hua residence,

20:42.980 --> 20:45.640
this sachet strangely appeared out of nowhere.

20:45.820 --> 20:46.630
The ink

20:46.910 --> 20:48.710
was also clearly freshly dried.

20:49.460 --> 20:51.920
It must have been written by a living person.

20:51.940 --> 20:53.600
In the entire Gong residence,

20:53.890 --> 20:55.620
there are many who can teach me.

20:56.600 --> 20:57.480
But like this,

20:57.510 --> 20:58.550
secretly,

20:58.750 --> 21:01.150
and even doing it in the name of my father...

21:01.230 --> 21:03.890
It could only be someone with a huge ego like you.

21:08.860 --> 21:11.180
Back then, when you broke into the prison to save Yun Weishan,

21:11.180 --> 21:12.100
we fought

21:13.460 --> 21:15.090
and I noticed that your Three Forms of Moon Slash

21:15.090 --> 21:16.090
were full of flaws

21:16.210 --> 21:17.810
and your energy was in chaos.

21:18.180 --> 21:18.820
So,

21:19.700 --> 21:21.500
I wanted to give you some advice.

21:25.890 --> 21:26.740
Thank you.

21:31.220 --> 21:32.170
Back then,

21:32.570 --> 21:34.030
if I didn't find the sachet

21:34.580 --> 21:36.380
and had to spend three to five years

21:36.380 --> 21:38.970
to learn the Three Forms of Snow Saber and Three Forms of Moon Slash,

21:38.970 --> 21:40.260
what would you have done?

21:40.260 --> 21:41.590
Then I could have really

21:41.730 --> 21:44.390
kicked you out of the position of Sword Wielder.

21:46.430 --> 21:47.230
You could,

21:48.170 --> 21:49.170
but you wouldn't.

21:53.560 --> 21:54.360
You wouldn't.

21:55.330 --> 21:55.810
Right?

22:00.740 --> 22:02.200
I finally understand now.

22:03.500 --> 22:04.530
In this world,

22:05.480 --> 22:09.060
in terms of wanting a punk like me to mature and fulfill my potential,

22:09.060 --> 22:09.780
I guess

22:10.500 --> 22:12.900
you won't lose out to Yun and Jin Fan, right?

22:13.830 --> 22:14.800
You punk.

22:15.740 --> 22:18.200
I was exhausted dealing with your nonsense.

22:20.590 --> 22:22.250
Then, were you also pretending

22:22.250 --> 22:23.780
to be discontented with me?

22:25.110 --> 22:26.770
That was genuine discontent.

22:27.260 --> 22:28.140
Right now,

22:28.140 --> 22:29.690
when you look back,

22:31.090 --> 22:33.620
are you satisfied with that version of yourself three months ago?

22:33.620 --> 22:34.820
As the Sword Wielder,

22:35.580 --> 22:37.240
you were neither responsible

22:37.620 --> 22:38.560
nor competent.

22:40.420 --> 22:42.950
How could you have protected the Gong family?

22:44.370 --> 22:46.090
You've always lived a comfortable life

22:46.090 --> 22:47.420
and were unrestrained.

22:48.170 --> 22:50.100
If there was no one pressuring you,

22:50.450 --> 22:52.800
could you have been tough enough with yourself

22:52.800 --> 22:54.730
to break through the Three Realms?

23:05.520 --> 23:07.180
Brother Shangjue, thank you.

23:14.650 --> 23:16.180
You're now the Sword Wielder.

23:16.180 --> 23:17.240
Be more dignified.

23:17.960 --> 23:19.340
Don't always act like Yuanzhi

23:19.340 --> 23:21.340
and keep calling everyone brother.

23:23.730 --> 23:24.250
Okay.

23:25.400 --> 23:27.000
You may leave now, Shangjue.

23:58.090 --> 23:59.040
Young Master Xue.

23:59.040 --> 24:00.210
The tea set is ready.

24:02.550 --> 24:03.350
You may leave.

24:07.750 --> 24:08.750
Young Master Xue.

24:08.900 --> 24:10.710
You suddenly abolished the Burial Snow Heart Sutra

24:10.710 --> 24:12.900
and can no longer restore your youthful vigor.

24:12.900 --> 24:13.670
Your body

24:14.020 --> 24:15.430
is also aging progressively.

24:15.430 --> 24:17.160
You're not as strong as before.

24:17.620 --> 24:18.720
It's cold outside.

24:19.220 --> 24:20.840
Let me get you another coat.

24:24.610 --> 24:25.230
No need.

24:45.020 --> 24:45.910
Stop crying.

24:47.170 --> 24:48.430
Remember to bury me

24:48.980 --> 24:50.050
closer to you.

24:52.220 --> 24:53.950
Also, don't build a tombstone.

24:54.940 --> 24:57.020
It'll look too sad and lonely.

25:00.730 --> 25:02.170
Plant a cedar tree.

25:03.040 --> 25:05.030
It stays green for all four seasons,

25:05.030 --> 25:07.230
yet it turns white when covered in snow.

25:12.160 --> 25:13.490
The snow in the back hill

25:14.460 --> 25:15.830
will never melt.

25:17.860 --> 25:19.360
Bury me under the tree.

25:20.100 --> 25:20.760
In this way,

25:21.530 --> 25:24.120
I can always have tea with you in the snow.

25:26.790 --> 25:27.990
There's no next year.

25:28.300 --> 25:29.360
Have you forgotten

25:30.120 --> 25:32.520
that I practice the Burial Snow Heart Sutra

25:32.950 --> 25:34.410
and restore my youthful vigor

25:34.410 --> 25:35.950
every four years?

25:38.020 --> 25:39.200
Next spring

25:39.830 --> 25:42.230
will be when I break through the last level.

25:42.380 --> 25:43.580
If I break through it,

25:44.440 --> 25:45.350
my body

25:46.240 --> 25:47.060
and memories

25:47.990 --> 25:49.480
will be renewed.

25:50.780 --> 25:51.890
I will forget you

25:53.770 --> 25:55.140
completely.

26:02.260 --> 26:03.920
It's good if you forget me too.

26:05.030 --> 26:06.160
I can't bear for you

26:07.230 --> 26:09.630
to keep holding a grudge against me anyway.

26:10.060 --> 26:11.710
Why will I hold a grudge against you?

26:11.710 --> 26:12.240
You will.

26:13.190 --> 26:15.120
You will hate me for abandoning you

26:15.140 --> 26:16.940
and making you live a solitary life

26:16.940 --> 26:17.940
in loneliness.

26:18.030 --> 26:19.170
Jerk!

26:19.420 --> 26:20.560
Then you can't die!

26:22.840 --> 26:24.420
Didn't you say that the outside world

26:24.420 --> 26:25.940
is always sunny...

26:29.820 --> 26:31.150
and cloudless?

26:32.980 --> 26:35.510
Is the outside world really as nice as he said?

26:35.850 --> 26:38.740
If there's a chance, I really want to go out and have a look.

26:38.740 --> 26:39.660
Do you think

26:39.660 --> 26:40.660
it's not fun here,

26:41.130 --> 26:42.260
so you want to leave?

26:42.770 --> 26:44.770
This place is really boring indeed.

26:44.940 --> 26:46.400
It's a world of ice and snow

26:46.660 --> 26:47.680
all year round.

26:48.740 --> 26:49.790
But don't worry.

26:50.380 --> 26:51.840
As long as you don't leave,

26:51.860 --> 26:52.660
I won't leave.

26:53.860 --> 26:55.120
I'll always be with you

26:56.410 --> 26:58.010
and we'll be bored together.

26:58.260 --> 26:59.390
That's more like it.

27:05.400 --> 27:07.130
I think I saw

27:09.110 --> 27:10.910
such a vast and brilliant place.

27:13.730 --> 27:15.860
It's really like what I dreamed about.

27:19.480 --> 27:20.160
Let me

27:21.220 --> 27:22.950
go and take a look for you first.

28:05.130 --> 28:08.850
♫Will I see you again?♫

28:11.820 --> 28:14.910
♫The summer we spent together is a blur now♫

28:18.480 --> 28:22.160
♫Night breezes tousled your gray hair♫

28:25.070 --> 28:28.400
♫You looked at me in silence♫

28:31.000 --> 28:36.410
♫When you put your hands on my shoulders♫

28:37.990 --> 28:42.510
♫All my fear and hesitation were gone♫

28:44.290 --> 28:49.570
♫♫Snow falls and my wound will never close♫

28:47.380 --> 28:48.310
Long time no see.

28:51.070 --> 28:51.870
How are you?

28:51.460 --> 28:55.420
♫Thank you, and sorry♫

29:01.960 --> 29:05.170
♫Yesterday fades like a distant mountain♫

29:08.540 --> 29:10.950
♫Tears are the snow♫

29:12.290 --> 29:13.820
♫On the top of the mountain♫

29:38.580 --> 29:40.240
Your sister is very happy now.

29:41.700 --> 29:43.300
She has someone who loves her

29:44.020 --> 29:45.220
and a peaceful abode.

29:48.990 --> 29:50.190
You can rest assured.

30:16.620 --> 30:17.490
What about you?

30:19.840 --> 30:20.880
Are you

30:21.850 --> 30:22.680
happy now?

30:34.460 --> 30:35.100
Yes.

30:43.290 --> 30:45.350
When I was little, my sister once said

30:46.280 --> 30:47.540
that after people die,

30:47.700 --> 30:48.900
they become butterflies

30:48.900 --> 30:49.820
or insects

30:51.500 --> 30:53.830
and go see their beloved ones who they miss

30:54.380 --> 30:55.780
or their family members.

31:02.550 --> 31:04.550
Then you mustn't turn into a spider.

31:04.840 --> 31:06.100
I'm scared of spiders.

31:20.400 --> 31:22.370
You will definitely recognize me,

31:23.960 --> 31:24.660
right?

31:30.650 --> 31:31.070
Yes.

31:32.800 --> 31:33.580
I will.

31:43.770 --> 31:44.370
Elder Yue.

31:47.980 --> 31:49.580
While tidying up Young Master Hua's belongings that he left behind,

31:49.580 --> 31:50.540
I found this box.

31:50.810 --> 31:52.340
He planned to give it to you.

32:18.740 --> 32:20.740
My sister gave me that bracelet.

32:23.310 --> 32:24.100
After I first put it on,

32:24.100 --> 32:25.700
I've never taken it off once.

32:27.490 --> 32:28.550
When you come back,

32:29.250 --> 32:30.780
I'll put it on for you again.

32:36.530 --> 32:37.530
I'll ask the Gong family's

32:37.530 --> 32:39.620
best craftsman, Young Master Hua,

32:40.770 --> 32:42.840
to make a new bracelet for you.

32:44.810 --> 32:45.640
I'll carve

32:47.890 --> 32:49.090
a crescent moon on it.

32:53.180 --> 32:53.790
Okay.

33:13.250 --> 33:15.180
You will definitely recognize me,

33:16.820 --> 33:17.450
right?

33:22.850 --> 33:23.570
I will.

33:38.340 --> 33:39.670
What are you looking at?

33:40.580 --> 33:42.540
Hanya Si actually left me a letter.

33:44.820 --> 33:46.480
My background is stated in it.

33:47.560 --> 33:49.220
Then you should read it first.

33:49.580 --> 33:51.040
You don't have to evade it.

33:51.500 --> 33:53.100
I planned to tell you anyway.

33:56.150 --> 33:56.870
It turns out

33:58.270 --> 34:00.870
that I'm really the daughter of the Yun family.

34:01.180 --> 34:03.040
That year, the Yun family gave birth to

34:03.040 --> 34:04.330
a pair of twins.

34:41.270 --> 34:42.820
No wonder, back then, when Gong Shangjue

34:42.820 --> 34:44.570
was suspicious of your identity

34:44.570 --> 34:46.570
and took your portrait to Lixi Town,

34:46.780 --> 34:48.030
he found nothing.

34:49.440 --> 34:50.710
So you have a twin.

34:55.179 --> 34:57.750
Why are you carrying so many things on your own?

34:57.750 --> 34:59.210
Why don't you ask for help?

35:00.490 --> 35:01.820
I don't need their help.

35:02.340 --> 35:03.870
I chose everything myself.

35:04.020 --> 35:04.680
Take a look.

35:04.860 --> 35:05.790
Do you like them?

35:10.150 --> 35:11.220
Of course I do.

35:20.800 --> 35:22.060
If you don't like them,

35:22.330 --> 35:23.790
you don't have to force it.

35:24.050 --> 35:26.050
You don't have to accept any of them.

35:27.380 --> 35:28.840
Who said I don't like them?

35:38.090 --> 35:38.860
Yun.

35:41.380 --> 35:42.250
I like you.

35:43.980 --> 35:45.660
So I really want to be with you

35:46.060 --> 35:47.180
forever.

35:48.710 --> 35:49.340
But

35:50.460 --> 35:51.920
what I hope for even more is

35:52.640 --> 35:54.370
that you can be happy every day,

35:55.300 --> 35:57.410
instead of being trapped in the Gong residence

35:57.410 --> 35:58.630
like my mother.

36:00.970 --> 36:01.560
So,

36:02.830 --> 36:04.820
if you want to leave the Gong residence...

36:04.820 --> 36:06.160
How am I trapped in here?

36:07.720 --> 36:08.580
With you here,

36:09.560 --> 36:12.020
this is the most peaceful place in the world.

36:15.840 --> 36:17.570
The rarest feeling in the world

36:18.040 --> 36:19.160
is to feel at ease.

36:20.170 --> 36:22.030
Haven't you heard of that saying?

36:24.280 --> 36:26.540
Then why did you pack a little travel bag?

36:26.580 --> 36:27.380
What about me?

36:31.030 --> 36:33.690
I just want to go back to Lixi Town and have a look.

36:34.650 --> 36:36.980
I always thought I was alone in this world.

36:38.400 --> 36:39.350
I never thought

36:40.420 --> 36:42.150
that I would even have a family.

36:43.050 --> 36:43.850
But

36:44.570 --> 36:45.700
I'm a little scared.

36:48.860 --> 36:49.790
Don't be afraid.

36:50.720 --> 36:53.940
It's just the common anxiety of returning to your hometown after a long time.

36:53.940 --> 36:54.960
Unfortunately,

36:56.180 --> 36:57.510
I can't go back with you.

36:58.600 --> 36:59.260
I know.

37:00.220 --> 37:03.120
You have the Infinite Heat's Coded Heart Sutra on your body,

37:03.120 --> 37:05.050
so you can't leave Jiuchen Valley.

37:06.340 --> 37:08.140
I'll be back in two to three days.

37:08.540 --> 37:09.270
Don't worry.

37:11.110 --> 37:12.770
I'll wait for you to come back.

37:30.260 --> 37:31.300
I just want to see

37:31.320 --> 37:33.120
what you're hiding in your hand.

37:34.140 --> 37:35.670
Why did you close your eyes?

37:41.750 --> 37:43.210
I brought you a love braid.

37:43.970 --> 37:45.170
I'll put it on for you.

37:54.110 --> 37:56.240
You can't accept any more love braids.

37:58.720 --> 38:00.980
Then you can't marry anyone else either.

38:01.590 --> 38:02.720
Of course I won't...

38:08.950 --> 38:10.410
I won't marry anyone else.

38:10.690 --> 38:11.690
Only you.

38:19.210 --> 38:20.650
Why send the green silk?

38:23.920 --> 38:25.850
Worry about your lack of clothing.

38:29.180 --> 38:30.580
Not envious of the world.

38:31.890 --> 38:33.750
Only the cloud knows the feather.

38:48.120 --> 38:49.460
Why are you sneaking around

38:49.460 --> 38:50.540
and being secretive by yourself?

38:50.540 --> 38:51.580
What happened?

38:52.010 --> 38:53.540
It's something important.

38:53.740 --> 38:55.290
Must you do it alone?

38:55.430 --> 38:55.780
Yes.

38:55.910 --> 38:56.640
Of course.

38:56.900 --> 38:57.990
It's highly confidential.

38:57.990 --> 38:59.790
I have to be a lone and brave hero.

39:04.800 --> 39:06.930
It's too dangerous for you to go alone.

39:07.020 --> 39:07.950
I'll follow you.

39:12.680 --> 39:13.900
How long will you be gone for?

39:13.900 --> 39:15.820
For about two hours.

39:15.970 --> 39:16.780
That long?

39:16.800 --> 39:17.150
Yes.

39:18.530 --> 39:20.870
Can't you let me follow you from afar?

39:21.230 --> 39:22.490
What's wrong with you?

39:22.500 --> 39:23.420
You're so clingy...

39:23.420 --> 39:24.230
Stop talking.

39:24.760 --> 39:25.160
Hurry.

39:26.820 --> 39:28.920
♫Sighing at the lights and song♫

39:28.940 --> 39:31.040
♫Weaving the world's lights♫

39:31.140 --> 39:32.300
♫Sigh at the beautiful scenery♫

39:32.300 --> 39:34.430
♫Who will enjoy it with me?♫

39:34.560 --> 39:36.750
♫Where the lights fall upon♫

39:37.100 --> 39:39.010
♫People come♫

39:39.180 --> 39:41.550
♫And people go♫

39:43.770 --> 39:44.260
You go.

39:44.490 --> 39:44.930
Okay.

39:44.670 --> 39:46.610
♫You and I look♫

39:46.790 --> 39:48.930
♫At the long galaxy between us♫

39:49.050 --> 39:49.980
♫What can we do?♫

39:50.140 --> 39:52.310
♫Flowers fall with the rain♫

39:51.300 --> 39:52.160
This is for you.

39:52.370 --> 39:54.470
♫The wind doesn't ask the clouds♫

39:54.850 --> 39:56.460
♫The clouds♫

39:55.970 --> 39:57.100
You two brothers

39:57.210 --> 39:58.950
shouldn't assume that I'm not good at anything.

39:57.280 --> 39:59.470
♫Don't speak too♫

39:59.130 --> 40:01.120
Although I'm a young lady,

40:01.180 --> 40:02.430
I also have

40:01.280 --> 40:03.410
♫I'm waiting for the wind without pain♫

40:02.950 --> 40:03.860
the heart of a craftsman.

40:03.430 --> 40:06.220
♫Waiting for when I can't stand how much I miss you to get drunk♫

40:06.220 --> 40:08.090
♫Waiting for the snow to not be lost♫

40:07.030 --> 40:07.520
Sister.

40:07.620 --> 40:08.330
Don't worry.

40:08.110 --> 40:10.670
♫Waiting for the cold to leave and when everything grows♫

40:08.730 --> 40:10.250
We've never regarded you as a young lady.

40:10.250 --> 40:10.990
That's good.

40:11.010 --> 40:12.410
♫Waiting for the moon in the poem♫

40:12.410 --> 40:14.950
♫To make a bottle of forever and ever♫

40:15.040 --> 40:16.930
♫Taste all the warmth♫

40:16.950 --> 40:18.880
♫And let's talk about leaving for somewhere far♫

40:18.880 --> 40:20.980
♫I'm waiting for my beloved to return home♫

40:20.410 --> 40:21.860
This exquisite glove

40:21.010 --> 40:23.780
♫Waiting for the rainy night lit by the red candles by the west window♫

40:21.880 --> 40:23.080
is a marvelous creation.

40:23.080 --> 40:24.110
Just like me,

40:24.180 --> 40:25.300
♫Waiting for the leaves to fall and the white snow♫

40:24.500 --> 40:26.140
it's priceless...

40:25.690 --> 40:28.260
♫Write the story on the thick snow♫

40:28.450 --> 40:30.060
♫Waiting for our story♫

40:28.950 --> 40:30.590
and unavailable.

40:30.080 --> 40:32.710
♫To be spread everywhere by the wind♫

40:31.030 --> 40:32.090
That's what I mean.

40:32.870 --> 40:35.470
♫Ferment all the longing♫

40:33.620 --> 40:35.020
What are you laughing at?

40:35.510 --> 40:39.820
♫Cherish all the past♫

40:37.700 --> 40:39.100
Call me brother-in-law.

40:42.100 --> 40:43.030
Let's go, honey.

40:43.030 --> 40:45.090
Let's go back and feed the fireflies.

40:52.550 --> 40:58.080
♫You whisper loving words in my ear♫

40:59.570 --> 41:04.700
♫Yet we have no choice but to part♫

41:03.040 --> 41:05.170
Because the symbolism of the azalea is

41:06.540 --> 41:07.800
that I belong to you forever.

41:06.660 --> 41:12.470
♫I hold the blade in my hand♫

41:12.750 --> 41:17.980
♫And slice through the night♫

41:19.620 --> 41:23.170
♫Feelings are always so bland on paper♫

41:23.560 --> 41:26.290
♫But writing it feels so bitter and intolerable♫

41:26.680 --> 41:30.310
♫I mock people who are obsessed with love and hate♫

41:30.590 --> 41:33.420
♫But only half my heart remains♫

41:33.330 --> 41:34.380
I belong to you forever.

41:33.780 --> 41:37.730
♫Only I looked up when we crossed paths♫

41:38.080 --> 41:40.180
♫Leaving a moment behind♫

41:40.700 --> 41:44.940
♫At the shore of the flow of time♫

41:45.180 --> 41:47.190
♫I heard a door open♫

41:47.390 --> 41:50.690
♫The later the night, the warmer the heart♫

41:50.900 --> 41:54.370
♫Yet the hug feels colder than the snow♫

41:55.620 --> 41:57.090
♫Why do we♫

41:58.250 --> 42:01.290
♫Stand side by side?♫

42:02.680 --> 42:08.470
♫Like fireflies meeting in the same night♫

42:09.550 --> 42:14.610
♫But the heart catches fire♫

42:16.670 --> 42:22.580
♫The night is young but the heart is heavy♫

42:22.790 --> 42:28.900
♫The moth embraces the blazing flames♫

44:07.200 --> 44:08.840
Why are you already here

44:08.860 --> 44:10.990
when the guardians are not even awake?

44:11.430 --> 44:12.680
Today is the day that Yun will be

44:12.680 --> 44:13.730
coming back.

44:14.020 --> 44:15.220
I want to wait for her.

44:18.180 --> 44:20.640
Are you going to wait here for the entire day?

44:21.710 --> 44:22.710
Leave me alone.

44:25.150 --> 44:26.350
Wait on your own then.

44:42.270 --> 44:44.680
♫The memories you saw in your dream♫

44:45.610 --> 44:46.710
♫Shone bright♫

44:47.620 --> 44:48.650
♫In the rain♫

44:50.020 --> 44:52.660
♫I set time into a chess game♫

44:53.480 --> 44:55.580
♫Waiting for you♫

44:57.760 --> 45:00.530
♫Every encounter is good luck♫

45:01.660 --> 45:04.300
♫Every farewell is a regret♫

45:05.520 --> 45:10.400
♫Fate is waiting to be written by the blade♫

45:13.230 --> 45:16.000
♫The traces you left in the dream♫

45:16.710 --> 45:17.840
♫It's like a riddle♫

45:18.580 --> 45:19.730
♫There's no answer♫

45:20.970 --> 45:23.590
♫I sewed winter clothes with memories♫

45:24.390 --> 45:25.620
♫Every needle♫

45:25.870 --> 45:27.870
♫Reminds me of you♫

45:28.760 --> 45:31.660
♫Suddenly I forget the world♫

45:32.630 --> 45:35.690
♫I hold your hand and worry about your lack of clothing♫

45:36.420 --> 45:42.760
♫Without regret, the fallen do not give up on the world♫

45:42.950 --> 45:45.770
♫I cross mountains and rivers to run towards you♫

45:46.100 --> 45:47.700
♫To find you♫

45:48.120 --> 45:50.510
♫And embrace your heart♫

45:50.810 --> 45:53.170
♫I don't care about their reminder♫

45:53.920 --> 45:57.650
♫I grip tightly to the blade♫

45:58.430 --> 46:01.280
♫Let this sharp blade be the brush♫

46:01.630 --> 46:03.320
♫To carve in my heart♫

46:03.570 --> 46:06.150
♫You and me♫

46:06.420 --> 46:13.190
♫A world only for us♫

46:42.180 --> 46:45.010
♫The traces you left in the dream♫

46:45.450 --> 46:46.770
♫It's like a riddle♫

46:47.540 --> 46:48.650
♫There's no answer♫
